The third installment of the annual NetHack Cross-Variant Summer Tournament
called Junethack has started on Saturday June 1st 2013 at midnight UTC and
will be running until the end of June.

http://junethack.de/

This year's installment features additional cross variant achievements
for reaching some goals in all or half of the variants, new clan
trophies (logarithmic points, most Medusa kills, most games with all
conducts broken), a (rudimentary) mobile version of the site, and last
but not least, the UnNetHack 5 release candidate.

This year's line-up of supported games is the same as last year:
 * Vanilla NetHack
 * SporkHack 
 * UnNethack
 * AceHack
 * GruntHack
 * NetHack4

You can get in contact with the organizers of Junethack here or in the
#junethack IRC channel on the Freenode IRC network.

